--[[
    KATO HUB - MAIN MENU v2.2 UTILITIES UPDATE
    GUI: WinUI-inspired custom interface
    Target: Roblox Executor environment

    Merged features from the older animated menu:
    - Startup intro animation and gradient logo
    - Sidebar navigation: Home / Game Selector / Favorites / Recently Used / Utilities / Settings
    - Search, favorites, and recently-used list
    - EN / VI language toggle
    - Draggable window, minimize, close, and keyboard toggle
    - Responsive PC / mobile layout
    - Card and button hover animations

    The game-menu loader is kept in the same loadstring + game:HttpGet form
    used by the original Main Menu. The game entry URL is preserved below.
]]

